(text "Carga por el USB-C del TP4056 (IN+/IN- son su conector)." (at 12.7 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ad084fdf-a5cb-4292-9440-2281fa6eb883))
(text "D4 es el diodo del elevador y bloquea el retorno del USB del DevKit." (at 12.7 255.27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 69659465-36a3-4598-bcb9-40a4566c14de))
(text "R13/R14: 4.2 V de bateria -> 2.1 V en GPIO10 (ADC1)." (at 12.7 257.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid fdda7b04-ff42-44ea-8355-6885898d4935))
(text "Consumo estimado ~0.9 A de bateria con tiras al 50%:" (at 12.7 262.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 985c473f-494c-417a-b5fe-edd63bcde360))
(text "unas 6.8 h nominales. Limitar tiras a 300 mA (MT3608)." (at 12.7 265.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid f72c8cd1-8cb3-4d9c-a7c8-528eb99b285e))
(text "MT3608: Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + R15/R16) = 5.2 V en el riel, con FB despues de D4." (at 12.7 270.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid bd712738-2cdc-42ce-8aad-d2a50210a796))
(text "EN a VIN. L1 con corriente de saturacion de 3 A o mas." (at 12.7 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 373a775f-3677-44fd-8857-47726bda57c6))
(text "OPCION B: diseno discreto con TP4056, interruptor y MT3608 (alternativa a la opcion A)." (at 12.7 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 93e11b84-5a1d-4ace-bf4e-311ea26d36ea))
